  "description": "Implements support for serverless XMPP messaging and SOCKS5 content transfer. It also provides support for End-to-End (E2E) encryption. Ciphers and algorithms supported include:\n\n\n\nML-KEM\n\nML-DSA\n\nCurve25519\n\nCurve 448\n\nEdwards25519\n\nEdwards448 (Goldilocks)\n\nNIST P-192\n\nNIST P-224\n\nNIST P-256\n\nNIST P-384\n\nNIST P-521\n\nBrainpool P-160\n\nBrainpool P-192\n\nBrainpool P-224\n\nBrainpool P-256\n\nBrainpool P-320\n\nBrainpool P-384\n\nBrainpool P-512\n\nECDSA\n\nEdDSA\n\nECDH\n\nRSA\n\nAES\n\nChaCha20\n\nPoly1305",
